## 3. PROPOSED TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE
* **Mobile Applications (iOS & Android):** **React Native (Expo / React Native CLI)** delivering a native, smooth experience for property seekers, property hosts, and service artisans on both Apple iOS and Google Android. Includes push notifications, native geolocation/mapping, and camera document scanning.
* **Web Portal & Management Console:** **Next.js 15 (React)** with Tailwind CSS, built as a responsive web dashboard for property developers, bulk material procurement buyers, and administrative back-office staff.
* **Backend API & Workflows:** **Node.js (NestJS)** hosted on lightweight cloud infrastructure to manage multi-module business logic, booking workflows, and role-based permissions.
* **Database & File Storage:** **PostgreSQL** for relational data integrity (listings, bookings, service requests, and ledgers) paired with **Cloudflare R2** for zero-egress document and property photo storage.
* **Payment Integration:** **Paystack / Monnify** for automated local card billing, bank transfer payouts, and checkout escrow holding.

